            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[NoManos 2.6.0

- Combine unfinished spoken input in order and wait for speech and transcription before acting.
- Improve echo cancellation recovery, audio playback stability, and headphone diagnostics.
- Expand voice commands for detail level, silence, and restoring speech.
- Start fresh executor sessions when switching task topics.
- Correct per-turn cost accounting, rolling quota percentages, shared model limit pools, and usage history recovery.
- Display task timestamps with AM/PM and refresh the website demo and workflow documentation.
]]></description>
